Package: cytoweave
Type: Package
Title: Remote Control of a Running 'CytoWeave'
Version: 0.8.1
Authors@R: person("Robert", "McDermott", email = "robert.c.mcdermott@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Drives 'CytoWeave', a flow, spectral and mass cytometry analysis
    workbench, from R: every action an AI agent can take in 'CytoWeave' (open
    data, gate, tabulate statistics, compare groups of samples, test
    differential abundance and state, export files) is an R function that the
    open 'CytoWeave' window performs, so the analysis stays visible and its
    changes stay proposals the user accepts or rejects.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/cytoweave
BugReports: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/cytoweave/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    curl,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
